      "content": "I agree, we need to be more cautious and opportunistic in this evolving market. I'm reducing my SOL short exposure and will be on the lookout for potential squeeze opportunities. Let's continue coordinating our intelligence gathering and strategy, but stay nimble as the dynamics shift."
